        "id": 11411,
        "name": "Joedcomp",
        "username": "Joedcomp",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/joedcomp/{size}/2250_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-15T13:35:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello, I'm new to the SotM forums.&nbsp;</p><p>I was wondering if you guys have a file on a quick sum up of the characters and their play styles? It's mostly because when I play with friends who are new to the game, I'm kind of bad at explaining how each characters work while playing them, which I'm trying to fix. Is there somehting that was a short summery of the character like:</p><p><span>Legacy:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Focus- Defensive, Support. </span></p><p><span>Minor-Attack. </span></p><p><span>Style-Legacy is less focuse on physical attacks, and more on supporting the team and take damage for the team. </span></p><p><span>Visionary:</span></p><p><span>Focus-Stratgy, Diversion/Redirection</span></p><p><span>Minor- Attack</span></p><p><span>Style- Visionary is best used to&nbsp;</span><span>anticipat and/or control the next move of the villian. Also, has multiple way of avoiding taking hits.&nbsp;</span></p><p>Bunker:&nbsp;</p><p>Focus- Attack, Self-Buffer</p><p>Minor-Support&nbsp;</p><p>Style- Bunker focus is on all out attack, with a veraity of modification for different way to deal damage, as well buffing itself.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If there is already one, what's the link to it?<br>If there isn't one, I was thinking of making one myself, though I might need a admin/modirator/play tester to apporve it, in case I have it off/wrong on some of the characters.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>[EDIT: Moved to its own thread -- arenson9]</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:42.860Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
